OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency Department lead set to
OL,4,Astart in December
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Nick Branch has been appointed as
OL,7,Fthe new clinical lead for Guernsey's
OL,8,FEmergency Department.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said he would be
OL,11,Freplacing Dr Mat Dorrian who is moving
OL,12,Finto the role of medical director in
OL,13,FDecember.
OL,15,FThe government said Dr Branch had
OL,16,Fworked in the Emergency Department for
OL,17,Fsix years and was "looking forward to
OL,18,Fthe challenge that his new role would
OL,19,Fbring".
OL,21,FHe is due to start his role on 1
OL,22,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
